    "updated_at": "2022-03-10T10:44:42Z",
    "body": "I haven't checked if this is a problem in practice, but a theoretical problem here is the lack of defined ordering. That's also a problem with the extension point. That usually argues for a single algorithm or a more coordinated approach.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
